{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"34":{"eng-name":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)","ara-name":"كتاب اللباس"}},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4059,"arabicnumber":4059,"text":"Rapporté par Jabir ibn Abdullah رضي الله عنه : Nous retirions la soie aux garçons et la laissions aux filles. Mis’ar a dit : J’ai demandé à Amr ibn Dinar à ce sujet, mais il ne le savait pas","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":40},"chapter":{"id":13,"ara-name":"باب فِي الْحَرِيرِ لِلنِّسَاءِ","eng-name":"Regarding Silk For Women","isFirstHadith":false}}]}